WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.569
-Texas Senator Ted Cruz
refused to wear a mask

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:05.004
when talking to reporters,

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.906
and Joe Biden held his first
press conference as President.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.642
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:13.246
♪♪

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:16.182
The modern conservative movement
seems concerned above all else

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.717
with preserving
their solemn right

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.351
to be dicks
to everyone else around them.

00:00:19.351 --> 00:00:21.420
They like to say facts
don't care about your feelings

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.822
until you hurt their feelings

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.924
by politely asking them
to wear a mask

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.759
or stop using racist slurs,

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:27.927
and then they melt down

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:30.196
like they're being hobbled
by Kathy Bates.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.697
Case in point, yesterday,
a reporter

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:33.933
politely asked Ted Cruz
to wear a mask

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.701
during a press conference
inside the Capitol.

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:39.071
Now, remember that Cruz had the
option to get vaccinated early

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:41.073
because he's technically
a senator,

00:00:41.073 --> 00:00:42.475
even though
he looks like the guy

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:44.844
who has to work the stockroom
at Auto Zone

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.745
because he's too creepy
for the register.

00:00:46.745 --> 00:00:49.349
"Need my help out there, boss?"
"No, we're good."

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:52.484
But most people had to wait.

00:00:52.484 --> 00:00:55.088
And while there's some
early preliminary proof

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:57.724
that the vaccines help stop
the spread of COVID,

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.859
we just still don't know
for sure,

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:01.061
especially with the rise

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.996
of several more
contagious variants.

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:04.597
So if you're a decent
normal person

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.599
and someone politely asks you
to wear a mask in their company,

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:07.633
you do it.

00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:09.035
Ted Cruz, however, took it

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:12.072
as yet another opportunity
to be a giant [bleep]

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:16.108
-Yeah, when I'm talking
to the TV camera,

00:01:16.108 --> 00:01:17.177
I'm not going to wear a mask.

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:19.345
And all of us have been
immunized, so...

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.650
You're welcome to step away
if you like.

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.484
-"When I'm talking
to the TV camera?"

00:01:25.484 --> 00:01:28.754
What a weird little window into
what he thinks being on TV is.

00:01:28.754 --> 00:01:30.089
"If I talk to the camera,

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.058
it will tell the TVs at home
what I said.

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:34.460
I tell secrets to the phone,
and the phone is a gossip.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.395
And the person on the other end
finds out."

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:38.397
I'm going to start
using that myself.
Hello, I'm Seth Meyers.

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:40.433
Welcome to "Late Night
Camera Conversation."

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.768
Guess what happened to me today,
lens?

00:01:42.768 --> 00:01:45.505
Man, Ted Cruz is the Steph Curry
of being a giant dick.

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:46.973
He never misses a shot.

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:48.408
He's the kind of guy who would
come over to your house

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:49.475
for a dinner party

00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:50.609
and when you politely ask him

00:01:50.609 --> 00:01:52.278
to take his feet off
the table would say,

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.179
"You're welcome to leave
if you like."

00:01:54.179 --> 00:01:56.115
Again, remember,
in that situation,

00:01:56.115 --> 00:01:59.018
Ted Cruz was the one
who was vaccinated,

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:01.587
he's the one who was unlikely
to get sick.

00:02:01.587 --> 00:02:03.890
But apparently, he couldn't
care less if anyone else
in the room got sick.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.725
I mean, God,
no wonder his neighbors

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:07.393
ratted him out
when he went to Cancun.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:09.162
Do you know how unlikable
you have to be

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:10.796
for your neighbors
to go to the press?

00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:13.733
If you invite someone to go on
vacation and their reaction is,

00:02:13.733 --> 00:02:15.301
"I'm telling
<i> The New York Times,"</i>

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.503
you might be a bad guy.

00:02:17.503 --> 00:02:19.972
On "Law and Order," even when
they're investigating a murder

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:21.507
and try to talk to neighbors,

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:22.975
everyone opens their door
half an inch

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:24.743
and says,
"I don't know nothing."

00:02:24.743 --> 00:02:27.313
Meanwhile, Ted Cruz's neighbors
all have lawn signs that say,

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.715
"Ask me about Ted's trip
to Mexico."

00:02:29.715 --> 00:02:32.751
And as a reminder, just because
you personally get vaccinated

00:02:32.751 --> 00:02:34.820
doesn't mean the pandemic
is magically over.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.422
The virus is still circulating,

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:37.624
there's still variants
out there,

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:39.391
and until case numbers
are much lower

00:02:39.391 --> 00:02:41.361
and vaccination rates
are much higher,

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:43.729
other people around you
are still at risk.

00:02:43.729 --> 00:02:45.765
And, by the way,
Cruz was also wrong

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:47.433
about the official CDC guidance,

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:50.269
as CNN's Dr. Sanjay Gupta
explained.

00:02:50.269 --> 00:02:52.271
-The CDC guidance,
I just pulled it up again

00:02:52.271 --> 00:02:54.940
because the guidance
does change, admittedly.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.309
But it says even if
you've been fully vaccinated,

00:02:57.309 --> 00:03:00.345
you need to keep taking
precautions in public places --

00:03:00.345 --> 00:03:03.816
wearing a mask, staying six feet
apart, avoiding crowds.

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:06.252
For him, he's pretty
well-protected, admittedly,

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:09.622
against getting severely ill,
requiring hospitalization.

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:12.725
He may not be as well-protected
against moderate illness,

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:14.193
mild illness,

00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:17.063
and the possibility
that he could still

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:19.899
transmit the virus
to somebody else.

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:21.968
So when he's not wearing a mask,

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:25.237
he's potentially putting other
people in that room at risk.

00:03:25.237 --> 00:03:26.839
-And that's not even
taking into account

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:28.807
that any time you enter a room
with Ted Cruz,

00:03:28.807 --> 00:03:31.677
you're already at risk of being
in a room with Ted Cruz.

00:03:31.677 --> 00:03:33.279
Cruz, of course, doesn't care.
If Cruz thought

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:34.680
he could score points
with the base

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:36.516
by filling a squirt gun
with salmonella

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:38.517
and spraying it at reporters,
he'd do it.

00:03:38.517 --> 00:03:40.652
Although I guess we shouldn't be
surprised Cruz doesn't listen to
doctors.

00:03:40.652 --> 00:03:42.388
Can you imagine
being his doctor?

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:44.190
That's got to be a rough gig.
"I'll cough,

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.125
but I'm not turning my head."

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:48.160
Republicans have made
their opposition to masks

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.561
a culture-war issue
from day one,

00:03:49.561 --> 00:03:51.230
and their antagonism
has only intensified

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.531
during the Biden presidency.

00:03:52.531 --> 00:03:55.734
Last week, for example,
Kentucky Senator Rand Paul

00:03:55.734 --> 00:03:57.837
went after Dr. Anthony Fauci
at a hearing

00:03:57.837 --> 00:04:01.139
for telling people to wear masks
even after they get vaccinated,

00:04:01.139 --> 00:04:02.941
which riled up Fauci.

00:04:02.941 --> 00:04:04.577
-What studies do you have

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:06.278
that people who have
had the vaccine

00:04:06.278 --> 00:04:08.881
or have had the infection
are spreading the infection?

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:10.616
If we're not spreading
the infection,

00:04:10.616 --> 00:04:12.585
