-No, it's not --

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:14.554
-You've had the vaccine
and you're wearing two masks.

00:04:14.554 --> 00:04:16.456
Isn't that theater?
-No, it's not --

00:04:16.456 --> 00:04:17.990
Here we go again
with the theater.

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:19.592
-Oh, you know
you've gone too far

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:21.727
when you get the Brooklyn
version of Fauci.

00:04:21.727 --> 00:04:23.629
Rand Paul's such a dick,
Fauci's going to show up

00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:25.397
to the next hearing
in a leather jacket,

00:04:25.397 --> 00:04:26.832
jet-black hair,
and a switchblade.

00:04:26.832 --> 00:04:28.300
"Where you going, Tony?"

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:30.636
"There's a fellow from Kentucky
who's about to be unlucky."

00:04:30.636 --> 00:04:31.703
"What are you saying?"

00:04:31.703 --> 00:04:34.073
"He's about to get
a Fauci ouchie!"

00:04:34.073 --> 00:04:36.575
Seriously, guys, we're just
asking you politely,

00:04:36.575 --> 00:04:37.910
please, just wear a mask.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:39.812
Why can't you just be courteous
to the people around you

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:41.413
instead of melting down
like children?

00:04:41.413 --> 00:04:43.382
They're the people who show up
to Long John Silver's

00:04:43.382 --> 00:04:45.585
without shoes and,
when they get turned away say,

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:47.854
"Oh, I guess we're living
in Nazi Germany now.

00:04:47.854 --> 00:04:50.889
I guess the secret police are
just gonna come take me away

00:04:50.889 --> 00:04:52.758
for the crime
of not wanting my feet to sweat

00:04:52.758 --> 00:04:54.560
while I eat my breaded shrimp."

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.995
This is the kind
of culture-war BS

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:58.096
the right has been obsessed with
for the first two months

00:04:58.096 --> 00:04:59.198
of Biden's presidency.

00:04:59.198 --> 00:05:00.800
And that's because his response

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.067
