00:05:02.067 --> 00:05:04.403
has been overwhelmingly popular
so far,

00:05:04.403 --> 00:05:07.106
as has his $1.9 trillion
COVID relief bill.

00:05:07.106 --> 00:05:10.476
So Republicans have had trouble
coming up with an attack on him.

00:05:10.476 --> 00:05:12.445
For example, they've been
obsessing over the fact

00:05:12.445 --> 00:05:15.481
that, until today, Biden hadn't
held a formal press conference.

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:17.649
And look, I'm all for
press conferences,

00:05:17.649 --> 00:05:19.518
but it all depends on
who's giving them.

00:05:19.518 --> 00:05:21.087
Press conferences
under the last guy

00:05:21.087 --> 00:05:23.856
