00:08:28.674 --> 00:08:31.376
Also, at least Biden can read
off a teleprompter

00:08:31.376 --> 00:08:33.279
without wincing like Rocky

00:08:33.279 --> 00:08:35.113
in the 15th round
with Apollo Creed.

00:08:35.113 --> 00:08:37.016
Whenever Trump read
off a teleprompter,

00:08:37.016 --> 00:08:39.051
he had the pained look
of a high school sophomore

00:08:39.051 --> 00:08:42.021
being forced to watch a video
on how babies are born.

00:08:43.756 --> 00:08:45.691
And Biden did start off
his press conference

00:08:45.691 --> 00:08:46.926
by making an announcement,

00:08:46.926 --> 00:08:48.961
that he would be doubling
his original goal

00:08:48.961 --> 00:08:50.228
of 100 million shots

00:08:50.228 --> 00:08:52.364
in the first 100 days
of his presidency.

00:08:52.364 --> 00:08:55.468
-On December 8th,
I indicated that I hoped

00:08:55.468 --> 00:08:59.471
to get 100 million shots
in people's arms

00:08:59.471 --> 00:09:02.241
in my first 100 days.

00:09:02.241 --> 00:09:05.611
We met that goal last week
by day 58,

00:09:05.611 --> 00:09:08.581
42 days ahead of schedule.

00:09:08.581 --> 00:09:10.850
Now today,
I'm setting a second goal,

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:14.787
and that is, we will,
by my 100th day in office,

00:09:14.787 --> 00:09:19.191
have administered 200 million
shots in people's arms.

00:09:19.191 --> 00:09:23.596
That's right, 200 million shots
in 100 days.

00:09:23.596 --> 00:09:27.967
I know it's ambitious,
twice our original goal.

00:09:27.967 --> 00:09:31.003
But no other country in
the world has even come close,

00:09:31.003 --> 00:09:33.906
not even close,
to what we're doing.

00:09:33.906 --> 00:09:35.607
I believe we can do it.

00:09:35.607 --> 00:09:36.875
-So he set a goal, met it,

00:09:36.875 --> 00:09:38.610
then said set a second,
more ambitious goal,

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:40.679
which has credibility
because he met his first goal.

00:09:40.679 --> 00:09:42.081
That's a novel strategy.

00:09:42.081 --> 00:09:43.649
It's certainly different
from the Trump strategy

00:09:43.649 --> 00:09:45.584
of overpromising
and under-delivering.

00:09:45.584 --> 00:09:47.285
If Trump had won a second term,

00:09:47.285 --> 00:09:49.321
he'd promise 200 million shots
by May 1st

00:09:49.321 --> 00:09:51.991
and end up giving out
200 million NFTs of shots

00:09:51.991 --> 00:09:53.292
by May 1st.

00:09:53.292 --> 00:09:55.460
"Every American will receive
a non-fungible token,

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:58.097
which is a high-resolution image
of a vaccine shot.

00:09:58.097 --> 00:10:01.000
It will be available for the
low, low cost of $69 million,

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.470
or for an even $70 million,
we'll throw in a gif

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:07.072
of a sparkly cat
playing with some yarn."

00:10:07.072 --> 00:10:09.007
That kind of announcement
is Biden at his best,

00:10:09.007 --> 00:10:11.877
when he's got the vibe
of an old-timer football coach

00:10:11.877 --> 00:10:14.579
giving his young squad an
inspirational halftime speech.

00:10:14.579 --> 00:10:15.748
"We can do it, folks.

00:10:15.748 --> 00:10:18.551
We can score 42 points
in the second half.

00:10:18.551 --> 00:10:20.652
And look, I know most of you
have broken bones

00:10:20.652 --> 00:10:22.354
because I forgot to teach you
how to tackle,

00:10:22.354 --> 00:10:23.889
but that's how we learn."

00:10:23.889 --> 00:10:25.224
That's when Biden's at his best.

00:10:25.224 --> 00:10:27.426
On the other hand,
he gets a little off track

00:10:27.426 --> 00:10:28.894
when he trails off,

00:10:28.894 --> 00:10:31.530
like he did at the end
of an answer on immigration.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:34.333
-We're building back up
the capacity

00:10:34.333 --> 00:10:37.602
that should have been maintained
and built upon

00:10:37.602 --> 00:10:39.905
that Trump dismantled.

00:10:39.905 --> 00:10:41.807
It's going to take time.

00:10:41.807 --> 00:10:44.477
And the other thing we're doing,
I might add --

00:10:44.477 --> 00:10:45.844
Am I giving you
too long an answer?

00:10:45.844 --> 00:10:47.947
Because if you don't
want the detail --

00:10:47.947 --> 00:10:50.582
No, no, but, I mean,
I don't know

00:10:50.582 --> 00:10:52.684
how much detail you want
about immigration.

00:10:52.684 --> 00:10:54.386
Maybe I'll stop there.

00:10:54.386 --> 00:10:58.423
-Yeah, we all know the press
famously hates the details.

00:10:58.423 --> 00:11:01.059
That's like a witness in
a courtroom telling the judge,

00:11:01.059 --> 00:11:02.661
"I mean, I know where
the bodies are buried,

00:11:02.661 --> 00:11:05.197
but you guys probably
all have dinner plans."

00:11:05.197 --> 00:11:07.099
And look,
it's absolutely frustrating

00:11:07.099 --> 00:11:08.733
that the mainstream media
has essentially

00:11:08.733 --> 00:11:11.203
laundered GOP talking points
by making it sound like

00:11:11.203 --> 00:11:13.005
there's a political crisis

00:11:13.005 --> 00:11:15.341
or national security crisis
on the border

00:11:15.341 --> 00:11:17.142
or that Biden created it
out of thin air

00:11:17.142 --> 00:11:20.279
or ludicrously asking him
if he moved too quickly

00:11:20.279 --> 00:11:22.448
in undoing Trump's cruel
and inhumane

00:11:22.448 --> 00:11:24.116
and dysfunctional
border policies.

00:11:24.116 --> 00:11:26.152
But on the other hand,
there is a very real

00:11:26.152 --> 00:11:28.153
humanitarian situation
on the border

00:11:28.153 --> 00:11:29.588
with unaccompanied minors

00:11:29.588 --> 00:11:31.090
who are fleeing poverty
and violence

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:33.292
and exercising their legal right
to asylum.

00:11:33.292 --> 00:11:35.160
They deserve safety and aid

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:37.329
and to be treated
compassionately and humanely.

00:11:37.329 --> 00:11:40.433
And to his credit, Biden did say
they should be treated humanely.

00:11:40.433 --> 00:11:43.568
We're capable of having all of
those thoughts at the same time.

00:11:43.568 --> 00:11:45.971
And I know that's a change
from the Trump era,

00:11:45.971 --> 00:11:47.873
when our brains were so fried,
we were incapable

00:11:47.873 --> 00:11:49.641
of having even one thought
at a time.

00:11:49.641 --> 00:11:51.876
For most of the Trump era,
my brain was so overloaded,

00:11:51.876 --> 00:11:54.213
I forgot my kids' names.
I just called them Guy and Dude

00:11:54.213 --> 00:11:56.081
or Lev and Igor.

00:11:56.081 --> 00:11:57.883
The moment Trump left office,
I suddenly remembered

00:11:57.883 --> 00:12:00.018
my ATM pin
and my wedding anniversary,

00:12:00.018 --> 00:12:02.988
which is why her present
was $200 in $20s.

00:12:02.988 --> 00:12:05.324
And there were some other
weird moments, too,

00:12:05.324 --> 00:12:07.593
like when Biden was asked
about the tidal wave

00:12:07.593 --> 00:12:10.562
of GOP voter suppression laws
Republicans have unleashed,

00:12:10.562 --> 00:12:12.764
the most ferocious nationwide
assault on voting rights

00:12:12.764 --> 00:12:14.133
since Jim Crow,

00:12:14.133 --> 00:12:17.369
with more than 250 anti-voting
bills across 43 states.

00:12:17.369 --> 00:12:19.104
Biden correctly
pointed that out

00:12:19.104 --> 00:12:22.241
but then went for an odd line
that I'm not sure made sense.

00:12:22.241 --> 00:12:24.743
-What I'm worried about
is how un-American

00:12:24.743 --> 00:12:27.412
this whole initiative is.

00:12:27.412 --> 00:12:30.682
It's sick. It's sick.

00:12:30.682 --> 00:12:34.486
And so, I'm convinced that
we'll be able to stop this,

00:12:34.486 --> 00:12:37.122
because it is
the most pernicious thing --

00:12:37.122 --> 00:12:40.726
This makes Jim Crow
look like Jim Eagle.

00:12:40.726 --> 00:12:42.461
-Jim Eagle?

00:12:42.461 --> 00:12:43.862
You talking about the Muppet?

00:12:43.862 --> 00:12:47.133
Jim Eagle sounds like a
desperate guess on "Jeopardy!"

00:12:47.133 --> 00:12:50.435
for the question, "He was the
lead singer of the Eagles."

00:12:50.435 --> 00:12:54.873
"Well, I know Jim Floyd was
the lead singer of Pink Floyd."

00:12:54.873 --> 00:12:56.675
Also, you know
there's a dude out there

00:12:56.675 --> 00:12:59.111
whose name is actually Jim Eagle
watching this saying,

00:12:59.111 --> 00:13:01.714
"What the [bleep]
Now I gotta change my name."

00:13:01.714 --> 00:13:03.849
I'm just kidding.
If there is a real man

00:13:03.849 --> 00:13:05.150
named Jim Eagle,

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:06.751
he's not watching TV
in the afternoon.

00:13:06.751 --> 00:13:09.187
Based on his name, he's probably
building a concrete dam

00:13:09.187 --> 00:13:10.789
with his bare hands.

00:13:10.789 --> 00:13:12.891
"Hey, Jim, the President
just said your name!"

00:13:12.891 --> 00:13:16.328
"Jim Eagle doesn't have time
for such foolishness."

00:13:16.328 --> 00:13:19.431
[ Laughter ]

00:13:19.431 --> 00:13:22.600
But whatever you thought
of Biden's press conference,

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:24.904
it was certainly refreshing
to see a President

00:13:24.904 --> 00:13:26.472
directly answer
reporters' questions

00:13:26.472 --> 00:13:28.273
without attacking anyone
or melting down.

00:13:28.273 --> 00:13:30.542
And, hey, Republicans, if you
didn't like his answers...

00:13:30.542 --> 00:13:32.477
-You're welcome to step away
if you like.

00:13:32.477 --> 00:13:34.446
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:13:34.446 --> 00:13:38.016
♪♪

00:13:38.016 --> 00:13:39.684
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:13:39.684 --> 00:13:42.121
over 2 million meals a year
to men, women, and children

00:13:42.121 --> 00:13:45.490
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,
and other serious illnesses,

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:47.426
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:13:47.426 --> 00:13:50.395
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the "donate" button.

00:13:50.395 --> 00:13:53.933
Stay safe, wear a mask,
get vaccinated. We love you.

